                        "email": "amithash@meta.com",
                        "username": "amithash"
                    },
                    "message": "So, making them common would be pulling all the service files over to meta-facebook/recipes-phosphor/gpio/*. Considering there are only two meta-ventura and meta-minerva which need it and that too for a very short duration I dont think its worth our effort. I can make a similar change over in meta-ventura?"
